  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI As</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se þe ðeof dearnunga feormige ⁊ ðæs facnes ⁊ ðæs fúles gewita sy, do him man þæt ilce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who secretly harbours a thief and is accessory to the crime and guilt, shall receive the same treatment.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et qui furem occulte firmabit et facinoris et sordis eius conscius sit, fiat ei hoc idem.</ab>
      </div>
